wrap
Applies to:
block-level elements
Inherited:
no
Percentages:
N/A
Computed value:
as specified
Canonical order:
per grammar
Animation type:
discrete
The values of this property have the following meanings:
wrap
The element inherits its parent node’s
wrapping context
. Its descendant
    inline content wraps around exclusions defined
outside
the element.
none
The element does not inherit its parent node’s
wrapping context
. Its
    descendants are only subject to exclusion areas defined
inside
the element.
Using the
wrap-through
property to control the effect of exclusions.
